#. y1:english="...Haha{MS:0}ha! Yeah, can you believe it?\nAnd then he looked at me and asked me||if I was 27 or something...\nNot even close{MS:0}, right?\nYeah. I'll graduate high school next year...||C'{MS:0}mon!\nIf I was, I couldn't drink then, could I?\nTrue...\nYou're funny.\n...\nBibibibibi...\nHmm?\nBingo{MS:0}! You guessed it, Kazuma-san!{MS:1}||How'd you guess? Did you already know?\nOh, you{MS:0}! You say that to all the girls?||You probably got tons of girlfriends.\nI don't care about other girls.||I wanna know what you think of me.\nOh, yeah. What I was gonna tell you.||That guy, he...\n...\nReally{MS:0}?||You found my profile somewhere, didn't you?\nMaybe. A guy wants to know everything||about the girl he's in love with.\nOh, yeah. What I was gonna tell you.||That guy, he...\n...\nC'mon{MS:0}. You know better that!{MS:1}||I'm very sensitive about my age.\nJust kidding. Don't get mad.\n...\n..."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:1_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:1_0_0"
msgid "...iJaja{MS:0}ja! Sí, ¿te lo imaginas?"
msgstr ""

