#. y1:english="Hey, {MS:0}Kazuma-san.\nYeah?\nIt's time for...||\"guess Aya and Kazuma-san's {MS:0}blood type\"!\nHuh?\nIf you guess right on the first try,||you might get something nice...\nSomething nice...?\nYeah, but you gotta get it on the first try.||Keep your mind outta the gutter, okay?❤\nUh, okay.\nOkay! So what's my blood type?\nIs it O?||...is that your final guess? Are you sure?\nA man doesn't change his mind.\n...\n...\n...\nYou got it! {MS:0}Alright, Kazuma-san!\nSo...? What's that nice thing...?\nYou already know the answer, don't you?\nIt's too dangerous for here though.||Next time, okay?❤\nYou serious?\nStop it! {MS:0}Don't look at me like that!||I was just saying it to be saying it.\n...\nNope! {MS:0}I'm O, of course.\nYeah, I should've known that.\nHey. Come on now, Kazuma-san.||It's no fun if you sulk.\n...\nYou {MS:0}could at least guess.{MS:1}||You're no fun, are you?\nThat's not going to win you any hearts.\n..."
