#. y1:english="...By the way, Kazuma-san,||w{MS:0}here do you live?\nNearby, {MS:0}huh?||{MS:1}I come here from Saitama.\nI hate all those gropers on the train.\nUm, that's bad. I feel sorry for you.\nYeah, and {MS:0}I got so mad today!||One of my friends asked me for some money...\nDoes this have something to do with gropers?\nN{MS:0}o! We're having a new conversation now.||Keep up with me here!\n...\nYou're lying, {MS:0}aren't you?{MS:1}||You don't have to lie to me.\nUh, yeah. You're right.\nCome {MS:0}on, Kazuma-san!||Be honest with me.\n...\nOh yeah?{MS:0}||That {MS:1}kinda sounds cool.\nDie young and have a beautiful corpse, huh?\nSomething like that.\nMy dad's like that.||Makes things hard though.\n...He even {MS:0}looks like you a little, hehe.❤\nYou can call me daddy and sit on my lap.\n Yay! Da{MS:0}ddy!❤"
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:1_11_0
