#. y1:english="...But in a c{MS:0}ostume, you know!||That's just too funny.\n...S{MS:0}o, if I was to dress up in a costume||for you, what would you like?\nA nurse, huh?{MS:0}||Guys all like nurses, don't they?\nWell, that is if I had to choose.\nDon't lie.||{MS:0}Y{MS:1}our face says you like nurses.\n(What kind of face is that...?)\nOf {MS:0}course! That's the most popular one!\nSo when you were in school, did you always||want your first girlfriend to be like that?\nWell, I'm just saying if I had to choose.\nOnly if you had to choose? Aww, I {MS:0}was||so ready to dress up as a school girl...❤\nOh, well. Too bad.❤\n...\nOh! {MS:0}I didn't think of that!||I like maids' outfits.\nA clumsy maid with glasses...||Would be cute, right?\nRight{MS:0}, right?\nFor you...||{MS:0}I might wanna {MS:1}serve you as a maid!❤\nYou'd have my complete attention.\nThank you, master!||This is so funny!\nYou're such a {MS:0}stick in the mud.\nI look stupid now. I'm the only one on stage||dancing by myself.\nI mean. of course you'd be cute.\nBoooo, too late now!\n..."
