#. y1:english="So{MS:0}, Kazuma-san...\nIf the girl you were dating cheated on you,||what would you do?\nSo you really couldn't forgive her{MS:0}, huh?||I'd forgive my boyfriend the first time.\nI'd never forgive him a second time though.\nI guess it would depend, maybe.\nWell, I'd never cheat.❤\nI believe you.\nWhat?!||T{MS:0}hat's not very masculine!\nIf it keeps us together, what's wrong?\nNothing, if you're okay with it, I guess.||{MS:0}But I don't like that...\n...\nYeah. {MS:0}That's the best.{MS:1}||You should try to talk it out first.\nBesides, maybe the reason she cheated on you||was because of something you did, right?\nIt {MS:0}could be.\nYou might not pay enough attention to her or||something like that. You can't be sure.\nA girl can get lonely easily.\nI guess so.\nBut a g{MS:0}irl that cheats on you||is no good!\nIf I was your girlfriend...||{MS:0}I would n{MS:1}ever cheat on you!❤\nHaha, I know.\nYou know everything,  Kazuma-san!❤"
