#. y1:english="When I get a {MS:0}boyfriend,||I totally devote myself to him.\nBut my boyfriends tend to feel too secure,||{MS:0}and then they cheat on me. Sniff...\nWell, yea{MS:0}h.||I'm kind of emotional.\nTurnabout is fair game,||huh?\nYeah, but{MS:0} I just get caught up\nin the moment. I'm honest about my feelings.||If you're not honest about your feelings,\nYou'll end up hurting the other person||more, right?\nYou would say {MS:0}that, wouldn't you?\nBut in some ways, it's only natural||for men to cheat, right?\nSo I wanna become a girl||that pleases her man so much that\nhe doesn't even think about cheating!\nI think you could probably do that.\nThanks{MS:0}. I'll try.\nReally{MS:0}?\nYou think I'm just a kid, so||you're not giving me any credit.\nYou can't {MS:0}fool me.❤\nWhat? You wouldn't {MS:0}believe it!{MS:1}||Sometimes, I wake him up in the morning\nor empty his ashtray||for him...\nBeing devoted to someone means||cooking and cleaning, doesn't it?\nYou {MS:0}think?||That's a housekeeper.\nNo girl does that anymore.\nOh..."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:6_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:6_0_0"
msgid "Cuando tengo {MS:0}novio,||me entrego a él en cuerpo y alma."
msgstr ""

