#. y1:english="I just wanna{MS:0} be||loved.\nBut guys with big hearts||are hard to come by.\nMaybe I'm just too picky.\nToo picky?\nYeah, I mean I have||two older sisters. I'm the youngest child.\nMaybe it spoiled me.\nReally?❤➿{MS:0}Can I?\nThen starting today, you're my||big brother, okay?❤\nBig brother...?\nYeah, I||always wanted a\nbig brother.||You'd make a good big brother.\nYou seem so reliable.\nProbably.\nWill you be there for me when I'm lonely?\nReally? T{MS:0}hanks!❤\nIn that case, I won't feel lonely||when I go home.❤\nNo! Y{MS:0}ou're my big brother.||We don't sleep together.\n...Oh, right.\nI'm so{MS:0}rry, Kazuma-san.\nI'll try to||grow up.\nGood.\nBut I think even {MS:0}grown-ups||want to be loved, too.\nYou're {MS:0}a pervert.❤\nBut I bet||it's true.\n100 percent.\nAnd you're wild, too...||Unbelievable, I'm sure.\nTry me.\nNo, thanks. I'll pass.\nI bet you've made lots of girls||cry, haven't you?\n...\nReally? {MS:0}I never would've figured you||for that kind of guy. So if we were to date,\nwe'd have to spoil each other,||wouldn't we?\nProbably.\nBut the people around us would||think we were strange,\nwouldn't they{MS:0}?\n...They probably would."
