#. y1:english="Oh, oh, did you {MS:0}know that||I'm a good cook, Kazuma-san?\nI always cook||for myself.\nI have lots {MS:0}of specialties!{MS:1}||But my best is omelettes.\nCooking... eggs?\nWell, yeah{MS:0}, but...||it's hard to make good omelettes,\nyou know!\nIs it?\nYup, but {MS:0}when I make them,||they turn out really good.\nAll fluffy and||delicious!\nSounds good.\nI'll make some for you sometime.❤\nI'm really {MS:0}good!||You really want to try my cooking?\nYeah.\nWell, you can't.\nI only cook for||that special person.\nSo you have to wait.❤\nWhat? Y{MS:0}ou{MS:1}||can cook? That's surprising.\nI'm an excellent cook.\nWell, then make me||dinner sometime.❤\nPack it with {MS:0}lots of love, okay?❤\nUm, okay.\nBooo! You don't {MS:0}believe me?{MS:1}||But you are perceptive, aren't you?\nThere's a way to use knives||even with long fingernails.\nIt's hard, but when I've just got||my nails done, I try to make stuff\nthat don't need knives.||I find ways around it.\nYou do, huh?"
