#. y1:english="You know what?{MS:0}||My birthday's coming up soon!\nThey're gonna throw me a party here,||so I bought a dress for the occasion.\nIt's really cute!||I want you to see it.❤\nReally{MS:0}? That's a promise, right?{MS:1}||I'm so happy that you're coming!\nI thought it was gonna be kind of||a bother...\nBut if you're gonna be there,||I have something to look forward to.\nI'm already excited.||I'll be waiting for you.❤\nEven if you have to be late,||be sure to come, okay?❤\nOkay.\nOh.{MS:1}{MS:0}||Too busy to even stop by?\nSorry.\nToo bad. I was hoping you'd come.\nBut people who are good at what they do||are always busy, I guess.\nThat's just the way it is.||Some people work themselves to death.\nI'm okay.\nThat's what they all say.||But then they just collapse.\nDon't work too hard, okay?\nI usually dress like a good girl!\nWhat does that mean?\nUmm...||Okay, next time I'll show you!\nI'd like that.\nLet's g{MS:0}o out to eat||before my birthday party.\nHm? Oh, okay.||What are we gonna do after that?\nWe'll come back here||and celebrate.❤ Okay?❤\nOkay.\nI'm so exci{MS:0}ted!\nUmm...Love!\nLove?\nYeah, and||something shiny, too. Heehee.❤\nNo one can say you're not honest.\nWell, to be totally honest,\nif I can see you,||that's all I need.\nTo hear you say||\"Happy Birthday\" standing right\nin front of me would be the best.\nIs that so?"
