#. y1:english="You look like you c{MS:0}an hold your alcohol.\nYeah, what about you?\nWell, I used to only||be able to drink cocktails,\nbut recently I've been||trying wine and\nchampagne||a little at a time.\nI guess I wanna look like||an adult or something.\nBut when I get drunk, I start acting like||a little girl.{MS:0} Teehee.\nReally?{MS:0} Okay, then I'll drink something.\nWaiter!||I'll have Cassis and grapefruit juice.\nYou're a b{MS:0}ore.\nFine, then. I'll be quiet||and sip on juice.\nWaiter!||Orange juice, please.\nMm? Are you saying||I'm the traditional type?\nActually, you may {MS:0}be on to something.\nI like stuff like fish jerky and||pickled foods.\nThe fish jerky here is so soft and||delicious! I recommend it.\nI'd love s{MS:0}ome! So you like it,{MS:1}||too!\nWe like the same things, don't we?❤\nI'd love s{MS:0}ome! So you like it,||too!\nOh, okay.{MS:1}{MS:0}||Don't fo{MS:2}rget."
