#. y1:english="Some day {MS:0}I want to open||a manicure shop. So I'm saving my money.\nYes, I am{MS:0}. T{MS:1}his job's okay,||but there are so many other\nthings I want to do.||{MS:0}It's fun to have a dream!\nYou think so?{MS:0}||{MS:1}Really? Thank{MS:2}s!❤\nMm. I gu{MS:0}ess to you{MS:1}||it sounds childish,\nor something...\nbut you don't need to||say it like that. You hurt my feelings.\nSorry. I didn't mean it.\nHumph.\nWell, that's {MS:0}a real{MS:1}||confidence builder. I guess to you\nit doesn't seem like I||could do it.\nBut I'm trying really hard!\nI didn't mean it like that. I'm sorry.||I know you're trying hard.\nThat was really mean...\nYeah, b{MS:0}ut I can't do this||forever, now,\ncan I?\nNo, I guess not.\nRight? You'll be||rooting for me, won't you?❤\nYou really {MS:0}mean it?!||I still need about 5 million yen, though.\nThat's a little more than I expected.\nHahaha.{MS:0}||Don't think so hard.\nEven if you were||really going to give it to me,\nI couldn't take it. After all,||it's my goal. I have to do it myself.\nI see.\nI'm going {MS:0}to be a stand up||Woman, you know?❤"
