#. y1:english="You only work at night?\nWell, actually, {MS:0}in the daytime||I go to school.\nI said I wanted to open a manicure shop,||right?\nI'm going to manicure||school.\nIt is{MS:0}.||And it's bad for your skin, too!\nYou get enough sleep?\nAbout 3 hours a day, I guess.||But once you get used to it, it's okay.\nI'm still young!\nKazuma-san, you're||like a big brother.\nIt's sweet of you to worry about me.\nHm? O{MS:0}h, sorry.\nYou've never heard of||\"nail art\"?\nYou paint fingernails with pretty colours||and decorate them.\nI'm really into it.\nI like to think about how to do it||differently from everyone else.\nI try all kinds of things on myself,||but when I'm doing it\ntime just seems to||fly by.\nOh, and there's lots of things you can do||to take care of your nails.\nOh, I see. That's interesting, isn't it?\nCuticle work and massages...\nOh, and you shouldn't use{MS:0}||fingernail clippers. And...\n(Why did I ask?)\nHm??\nDo you have some kind of||obsession or something?\nNo, what I meant was...\nI'm trying to ha{MS:0}ve||a serious discussion here!"
