#. y1:english="...Really? I find that hard to believe.\n...No, it's {MS:0}true.||I'm not really popular with the guys...\nWhat's your secret to popularity?\nSo I should ask {MS:0}the guy out?{MS:1}||Even though girls are taking the initiative\nlately, I'm not so sure about that...\nWell...||If it's not in you, I can't be helped\nYeah, I guess that's the way it is...\nI think I {MS:0}get it.\nRun if you're chased and chase if they run,||Right?❤\nThe trick is not to get greedy.||Guys can't really handle that.\nI don't think I'm {MS:0}greedy,||though...\nAre you sure you want to {MS:0}say that,||Kazuma-san?{MS:1} I wonder if you know\nwhat you're getting yourself into...||Haha.❤\nWhat? {MS:0}No I don't!||{MS:1}Is that what you think of me? How mean!\n...\nGood things?{MS:1}{MS:0}||There's a pot my grandfather has...\n(A family heirloom?)"
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:11_6_1
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:11_6_1"
msgid "...No, es {MS:0}cierto. Nadie me cree,||pero no tengo éxito con los chicos."
msgstr ""

