#. y1:english="...Yes{MS:0}, I really love the ocean, but there's||just nobody to take me. I don't mean\nswimming in the ocean. What I enjoy is||just watching the ocean in the winter time.\nOh. I thought you'd {MS:0}say that.❤\nBut ever since I was a kid, I've liked quiet||places more than the hustle and bustle.\nWell, I can't say that I blame you.\nHaha.\nYou think{MS:0}...?\nDoesn't sound like a hobby of a young girl.\nThat's just the way I am, I guess.||I can't help it.\nYou don't need to make fun of me...\n I alway{MS:0}s sing Traditional songs at karaoke.{MS:1}||It's embarrassing, so I don't go often.❤\nTraditional? I'd like to hear you sing.\nReally? If you'd sing a duet with me,||I guess it would be okay...❤\nIt's a deal.\nOkay, let's go sometime.❤"
