#. y1:english="Kazuma-san{MS:0}, this is purely hypothetical...\nWhat?\nWhat if right before your wedding...||The bride's dad said he was against it...\nWhat would you do?\nYou'd e{MS:0}lope?!\nIf the girl was really in love with me,||I wouldn't think twice.\nI know what you mean, but the families would||be so worried. It might be a little scary.\nJust like {MS:0}that?!\nFrom the father's point of view,||I'm trying to steal his daughter...\nWords alone wouldn't change his mind.\nBut you would give up without even trying?||I feel sorry for your bride.\nYou are the {MS:0}sincere type, Kazuma-san.\nHe'd understand if we had a heart to heart.||We're both men, we can compromise.\nMaybe, but I'm sure that no one would\never object to you||marrying their daughter, Kazuma-san.❤"
