#. y1:english_ids=["11_13_0","11_13_1","11_13_2","11_13_3","11_13_4","11_13_5","11_13_6","11_13_7","11_13_8","11_13_9","11_13_10","11_13_11","11_13_12","11_13_13","11_13_14","11_13_15","11_13_16","11_13_17"]
#. y1:english="...I even took {MS:0}cooking classes||like I was learning how to be a homemaker.\nYou did? Did you get good at it?\nI think so...\nIf your girl cooked you a meal||and it didn't taste good,\nWhat would you do?\nBut inside you'd {MS:0}think it's bad, right?{MS:1}||Wouldn't you feel sorry for her?\nEventually she would figure it out on her own.\nThat's no good...||You have to tell her!\nI mean it!\nThat's {MS:0}harsh, Kazuma-san.\nWhat's the point of eating bad food?\nMaybe...||It's good that you would tell her,\nbut I think you should eat a little,||at least to acknowledge the effort...\nThat's {MS:0}sweet of you.❤\nAnd until she got good at it||I'd eat it even if it wasn't any good.\nShe can take her time learning.\nSo romantic!❤\nIf you said that to her, she'd probably||try so hard to get better quickly."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:11_13_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:11_13_0"
msgid "... Incluso asistí {MS:0}a clases de cocina||para aprender a ser una buena ama de casa."
msgstr ""

