#. y1:english="...You know, I'm {MS:0}working at a hostess bar,||and I see interesting people, right?\nI'm having lots of fun everyday.\nYou are, huh? Good for you.\nWhen you choose a job, what||do you look for?\nI thou{MS:0}ght so.\nEven if the pay's good, the job sucks and||it's hard to make it through each day.\nYou got it.\nPeople with challenging jobs are so cool!❤||I think it's great.❤\nYeah. M{MS:0}oney is important...\nExactly.\nYeah, you're right...\nJust so you can eat?{MS:0}||That sounds kind of ignorant...\nMales used to go out and hunt for food.||If you can eat every day, that's enough.\nYou're tough, aren't you, Kazuma-san?"
