#. y1:english="...Yes, {MS:0}it is.\nEven if you're dieting and doing your best,||you just can't help it.\nFrom a guy's perspective it may seem silly,||but it's true.\nYou th{MS:0}ink?❤➿Thanks!❤\nYeah, you've got a great figure.||...may be hard to keep it, though.\nIt is!\nI get fat even if I'm not doing anything.||It's hard to stay in shape.❤\nMake sure you don't lose your breasts.\nI thought you'{MS:0}d say that.❤\nWhat? Yo{MS:0}u are?\nYeah, men have to diet, too, or||they'll get fat real quick.\nReally?||What kind of a diet are you on?\nThey say {MS:0}that's not good for you, you know.||It causes rebounds and stuff...\nOh.\nA well-regulated diet is best.\nSo man{MS:0}ly.\nIf you've got the guts for it||that's the best thing.\nOf course.||If you got guts, you can do anything.\nThat's the best thing, isn't {MS:0}it?\nIt seems so simple, but usually that's{MS:0}||the quickest way to get in shape, isn't it?\nYeah.||If you make the effort, results will come.\nI guess {MS:0}only women{MS:1}||can relate."
