#. y1:english="...Can I ask you {MS:0}something, Kazuma-san?\n...What?\nWhat kind of {MS:0}underwear are you wearing?\n...Why would you ask something like that?\nThey say that fashionable guys are picky||about their underwear. I was just wondering.\nBoxers, {MS:1}{MS:0}huh?||Most guys wear boxers, don't they?\nIs it because it keeps you cool?\n...They're just more comfortable.\nOh{MS:0}.||You're {MS:2}{MS:1}pretty average, aren't you?\nBriefs, {MS:1}{MS:0}huh?||Not many guys wear briefs, do they?\nBut briefs are||sexier, {MS:1}{MS:0}aren't they?\n...Really?\nHahaha. You wear them||because you're {MS:1}{MS:0}confident, don't you?\n...\nHahaha.{MS:1}{MS:0}||Are you serious?\n...Yeah.\nHow do you {MS:0}wear those?||I'd like {MS:1}to know.\n...I'll show you sometime.\nYes! {MS:1}{MS:0}Show me!"
