#. y1:english="...Whenever I finish work||I'm always so hungry.\n...Can't you just eat what||your customers order?\nNo, {MS:1}{MS:0}I can't do that. What would they think?||Some girls eat like a pig though.\nWhen I don't have a date after work,||I go to a ramen shop before going home.\nWhat kind of {MS:0}ramen do you like?\nReally? {MS:1}{MS:0}You like that kind?\nI {MS:1}{MS:0}can't stand it.||It hurts my stomach and it'll make you fat.\nIt makes me sick just thinking about it.\nI like the plain kind, too, but||it just seems like something's missing.\n...I guess {MS:1}{MS:0}we like different things, Kazuma.\n...\nReally?{MS:1}{MS:0}||I love spicy ramen!\nI got hooked on it,||and I just can't stop.\nI'll take you to {MS:1}{MS:0}the shop I like sometime.\nThanks."
