#. y1:english="The {MS:0}other day I saw||a great movie.\nAliens were gonna invade in 3 days||and kill everyone.\nI just wondered, {MS:0}what if||that was really gonna happen?\n...Hmm.\nWhat would {MS:0}you do?\nYou {MS:0}would?||You'd just go wild?\n...If we're all going to die anyway,||might as well go out with a bang, right?\n...The actor in the movie remained calm.||You're different {MS:1}{MS:0}to what I expected.\nSo {MS:0}you're the||romantic type, huh?\nIf I could end my life with someone I love,||I wouldn't ask for more.\nWell, {MS:0}yeah, but...\nDon't you think dying without even trying||to fight back would be a shame?\nYou're different {MS:1}{MS:0}to what I thought.\nThat's {MS:1}{MS:0}kind of how I pictured you.\n...I'm not going to just sit there and die.\nBut the aliens {MS:0}are way bigger than us...\nDoesn't matter.\nYou'd {MS:0}kick {MS:2}{MS:1}the alien's||ass, wouldn't you? Hahaha."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:16_13_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:16_13_0"
msgid "El {MS:0}otro día vi||una película muy buena."
msgstr ""

