#. y1:english="Kazuma-san, {MS:1}{MS:0}you're easy to be around.||I like being with you.\n...You do?\n...Yeah.{MS:0}||You're different from the other customers.\nDo you have a special someone right now?\n...That's kind of||a cliche, {MS:1}{MS:0}isn't it?\n...\nI wanted you to be serious.\nWhy {MS:1}{MS:0}would you be single?||There's no reason for you to {MS:2}be alone.\n...That's just the way it is.\nYou're treating me{MS:0}||like a child.\nI wanted you to {MS:1}{MS:0}be serious.\nI thought so.{MS:1}{MS:0}||You're too nice to be single.\nDo I still have {MS:0}a chance, though?\nReally?\n...Yeah.\nAlright!{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}||I'm gonna win your heart, Kazuma-san.\n...I see.{MS:0}||...No chance, right?\n...\nThat's okay, though.{MS:0}||You're like my boyfriend when you're here."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:17_1_16
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:17_1_16"
msgid "... Ya veo.{MS:0} ... Así que||no tengo ninguna oportunidad, ¿eh?"
msgstr ""

