#. y1:english="...Really, {MS:0}is that so?||But you seem like the dangerous type.❤\nThat's not true.\nHey, Kazuma-san...{MS:0}||Do you like cute girls or sexy girls?\nCute {MS:0}girls, huh?\nBut if you were with a cute girl, I bet||people would think you were paying her...\nHaha.❤\nThat's...\nHaha. You're {MS:0}pouting, aren't you?\nHow cute!❤\n...\nJust as I {MS:0}thought.||I knew you would say that.\nYou did?\nYou look like you like being around girls...||And you seem horny... but if you didn't like\ngirls you wouldn't be here, would you? Haha!\n...\nBoth, huh?{MS:0}||Greedy, aren't you?\nYou're right, though. Both is best, right?\nOf course.\nSo which am I?||Both?\nYou think?{MS:0}||People always tell me that.\nI would think.\n30/70 sexy to cute ratio?||Hahaha!\nYeah, that sounds about right.\nJust okay?\nNo, I mean...\nYou're not {MS:0}sure?||Okay, I see.\n...\nWhat?{MS:0}!{MS:1}||Too classy?\nSo you saw right through me, huh?❤||You've got a good eye, Kazuma-san. Haha!\nYou can't hide anything from me.\nYou know everything,{MS:0} don't you? Hehe.❤"
