#. y1:english="...It's what he said.||What do you think {MS:0}about that?\nHe said I was just a dumb girl.\nHe's no good.\nThe worst.||When we're home, all he does is sleep.\n...By the way, Kazuma-san, what do you do||on your days off?\nStay home, {MS:0}huh?\nDon't like the sun.\nHmm...\n...\nSo you like {MS:0}movies?❤||I do, too!\nWhat kind of movies do you watch?\nMe, {MS:0}too!{MS:1}||I love watching things blowing up!❤\nYeah, you gotta have action. Otherwise,||no reason to see it on the big screen.\nI know exactly what you {MS:0}mean.❤||Let's go to a movie sometime, Kazuma-san!\nYeah, sounds good.\nOh.{MS:0}||So you like the mature movies, huh?\nWhat do you mean?\nThey're too dull.||It's just no fun for me.\nThere are some interesting ones.\nOkay, I'll take your word for it.\nReally? I like {MS:0}anime, too!❤{MS:1}||They're fun to watch.\nAnime is now the spirit of Japan.||Pretty intense.\nI think we'd get along well, you and me...❤\nYou like to {MS:0}climb mountains?||I wouldn't have pictured you for that.\nClimbing mountains is a lot like life.\nIf you don't always focus on the peak,||it will be a difficult journey.\nAnd those that can't see the peak||don't know how to live.\nMaybe just too complicated for me...\n..."
