#. y1:english="...No! That's the one {MS:0}thing. Absolutely not!\nCockroaches?\nI hate them!||I get goose bumps just hearing the word!\nOh...\nNo way! {MS:0}I don't want to see them!\nThey've got cute little eyes, you know?\nNo, I don't even want to think about it!\nAnd the luster on their wings...\nStop it!\n...\nRight?\nI wish they'd just||go extinct.\nI couldn't agree more.\nBut, Kazuma-san...\nIf you and I were alone and a cockroach ran||across the floor, what would you do?\nAh, I'm so {MS:0}happy.{MS:1}||So you'd be brave for me, Kazuma-san?\nThat's a man's job.\nHum.❤\nWhat is it?\nI almost {MS:0}fell in love with you.❤\nOur relationship would be based on roaches.\nThat would be gross.||But that's what would happen, isn't it?❤\nNo way! {MS:0}It's impossible!\nBut if that's how you are,||I can't ever be alone with you!\n...\nI can't believe you, {MS:0}you suck!{MS:1}||You're terrible, Kazuma-san!\n..."
