#. y1:english="...Really{MS:0}?\nBut seriously, the reason you're||here is because\nyou want to be with somebody,||isn't it?\nI'm not saying {MS:0}I don't like honesty...{MS:1}||...but I don't know how to react to that.\n...\nThere you go again.{MS:0}❤||Are you sure? Then what would you do\nif I asked you to sleep with me tonight?\nHahaha!{MS:1}{MS:0}||You would have to, wouldn't you?\nI like that about you.❤\nDon't embarrass me.\nKazuma-san, you're so cute.❤\nYou're lying again!{MS:0}||You wouldn't do that.\nI would have to.\nIt's okay.\nI've never said that to a guy, and||I never will.❤\n...\nWhich is {MS:0}it?||You just have to say yes or no!\n...\nOh, never mind.||Shall we move on to the next topic?\n..."
