#. y1:english="...Just kidding.{MS:0}❤||Is that how you are, Kazuma-san?\nThey say love is blind.\nIt sure is.\nWhen I fall in love, I put a ball and chain||around the guy and treat him like a husband.\nI want him to talk to me everyday,||even if it's just a text message.\n...Is that obsessive?\nOh.{MS:1}{MS:0}||...Well, I wouldn't do that to you.\nDon't worry.\nOkay.\n...\n...\nYeah, {MS:0}that's what you say||now.\nBut if we really dated,||you'd get tired of it, I bet.\nReally?\nSo if I was like||a stalker or something, you wouldn't mind?\nYeah, {MS:0}I thought so.||I wouldn't want to be stalked, either.\nYeah, see?\nAlright!❤{MS:1}{MS:0}||I'm gonna text you a lot, okay?\nAnd if you hear footsteps behind you||at night, it's probably me.❤\nI'm looking forward to it."
