#. y1:english="...Yeah, you know... {MS:0}I like big guys.❤\nYou don't like guys that are built?\nIf I had to choose, muscular is better.\nOh. Well, I guess you don't have to||be single-minded in your interests.\n...How about ramen noodles?\nIf I asked you {MS:0}to take me out to eat,||what kind of place would you take me to?\nThat sounds good.{MS:0}❤{MS:1}||I'm kind of picky when it comes to ramen.\nI don't mind waiting in line to eat ramen...||Take me sometime, okay?❤\nSure, anytime.\nSpeaking of ramen, did you know there's\na shop where if you ask for \"half order,||extra soup\", you'll get a big surprise?❤\nWhat kind of surprise?\nI've never been there, so I don't know...\nA fancy {MS:0}restaurant?\nWhat's wrong?\nI don't really like places where||they're strict about manners. Don't you\nthink pasta tastes better when you can||slurp it up, making noises?\nYeah, I guess.\nJapanese{MS:0}?\nWhat's wrong?\nJapanese restaurants have a negative image.||Like, where insidious plots are made.\nThat's a strange thing to think.\nIt's probably just a prejudice I have...\n..."
