#. y1:english="...and then{MS:0} her||boyfriend just slugged her\nreally hard.\nHe's a bad guy any way you look at it,||but she doesn't want to break up with him.\nShe says he's going to be||famous someday.\nShe gives him money all the time.\nIf you're her friend, why don't||you try to talk some sense into her?\nI do try, {MS:0}but she doesn't listen.||She says that someday\nhe's going to change.||And she really believes it.\nWhat does it take for a guy like that||to change?\nYou {MS:0}believe in luck?||I didn't think you were that kind of person.\nWhat do you mean?||I'm not a bad guy.\nDon't get mad.||That's not what I meant.\nThis was just a||personality quiz.\nYou ask how a bad person can change,||and the answer tells about the personality.\nWhat?\nYou've made it this far in a||world of give and take, right?\nYou might have really good luck.\nIf I stick around you long enough,||maybe my luck will improve. Haha.\nSo you {MS:0}are the kind of guy that||depends on women?\nWhat do you mean?||I'm not a bad guy.\nHaha! Don't get mad.||That's not what I meant.\nThis was just a||personality quiz.\nYou ask how a bad person can change,||and the answer tells about the personality.\nWhat?\nI didn't really expect that||answer from you.\nAre you the type that doesn't like||opening up in front of people?\nAre you making fun of me?\n...Hmm. This quiz doesn't really||work, does it?\nAnd now you're mad.||That sucks.\nWhat do you mean \"beliefs\"?\nI mean the guy's principles or||whatever.\nOh. So you're {MS:0}a man of||beliefs?\nWhat do you mean?\nThis was just a||personality quiz.\nYou ask how a bad person can change,||and the answer tells about the personality.\nThat I'm a person of conviction?\nYes.||You're that kind of person.\nA man who lives by his beliefs.||Maybe it's not a really good\ntest, but I think that it's right||when it comes to you.\nHaha."
