#. y1:english="Yakuza {MS:0}fight a lot,||don't they?\nYeah, you just get used to it.||What's wrong?\nNothing.\nI was just wondering if you were||used to fights.\nAre you a good fighter?\nThe difference between a Yakuza and||a regular guy isn't how well they fight.\nIt's how used to it they are.\nOh.||That sounds pretty scary.\nBut being used to something||is not the same as liking it, right?\nDo you {MS:0}like fighting?\nReally? {MS:0}More than eating?\nAnd I thought you||were a quiet guy.\nMaybe having two sides||is a good thing, though. Haha.\nWhat do you think?\nWell, I'm not good with||guys like that.\nBut maybe being||around you will help me\nto change my opinion.\nOh.\nWow, you're like {MS:0}an action||star!\nI'm curious as to what you mean by||\"go too far?\"\nI often regret it when||it's  all over.\nWith the world in the state that it's in,||you kind of have to be able to fight.\nIt's not necessarily a bad thing.\nHmmm. It sounds {MS:0}like you||speak from experience.\nBut you've been in a lot of||fights, right?\nYeah, I can't count how many||anymore.\nThat sounds almost||like a pickup line.\nYou live by your instincts?\nYeah, I guess you could say that.\nHearing {MS:0}someone like that||wish for peace\ndoesn't really sound sincere.\n..."
