#. y1:english="...but you know, {MS:0}the other day||this really scary-looking guy\ntold me how much he likes dogs and cats.||It was totally unexpected.\nI realised you can't really||judge a person by appearances.\nWhat kind of animals||do you like, Kazuma-san?\nLike a brother?\nYeah, or a sidekick.\nThat sounds like {MS:0}a||Yakuza reason for liking dogs.\nI think a dog is more like a friend, though.\nHaha. {MS:0}You know,\nI think I know what you mean.||That sounds like you.\nHaha.{MS:0} I know what you mean,||but the reason you like them seems a little\ndifferent than most people.\nReally?\nYou think about unusual things,||don't you?\nYou wanna go see pandas together sometime?||Haha."
