#. y1:english="By the way, {MS:0}Kazuma-san.\nDo you like younger girls?||I mean like girls in their early twenties.\nWhy are you asking that all of a sudden?\nDon't worry about that. Quick...answer!❤\nHmm?||You {MS:0}hesitated a little.\nTo be honest,||I don't really care about age.\nYeah, {MS:0}you're right.||If you're in love,\nit doesn't matter, does it?\nHmm?||You don't sound {MS:0}sure.\nWhat's wrong?\nI thought it might be another quiz.||So I was\nbeing careful what I answered||to make sure I didn't get analyzed again.\nWhat? {MS:0}Don't read so||much into everything...\n...You're {MS:0}up front, aren't you?\nYou've gotta be||with questions like this.\nHaha.{MS:0}||If you're that open with it,\nsome girls might be turned off.||I don't mind, though."
