#. y1:english="...and on {MS:0}nights when I don't work||my parents have a strict curfew for me.\nSo lately I don't have||a boyfriend.\nAnd it's almost Christmas...||It's been more than 6 months...\nI'm starting to worry.\nIt {MS:0}is.||And Christmas is right around the corner.\nI hope I can find someone||before Christmas.\nYou are {MS:0}so nice,||aren't you?\nOkay, so I can take you||seriously, right?\nBut you know, I haven't had a boyfriend||for 6 months, so I scheduled myself\nto work on Christmas.\nCan you come here on||Christmas?\nKazuma-san.||You're no {MS:0}help...\n...\nSo then later on are we going to talk about||what we're going to do on Christmas?\nHahaha.\nOh. {MS:0}Yeah.||You're right.\nOf course not{MS:0}!||Kazuma-san!\nIt's just that||I like this job.\nSo I do a job I like on Christmas,||and then I spend time with the guy I like...\nWhat could be better?\n...\nYeah, {MS:0}well...\nIf I can live in your house,||it's okay.\nUm, I mean...\nHaha. {MS:0}I'm just kidding.\nI just wanted to see what||you'd say."
