#. y1:english="Hey, Kazuma-san{MS:0}. What kind||of shoes do you like on women?\nWhat are you trying to get at?\nWell, I have a thing||for shoes.\nWhat kind of shoes do you like?\nWhat?{MS:0}||Are you serious?\nNo. I'm just joking.\nAnswer me {MS:0}for real...\nYeah!{MS:0}||Boots, right?\nI can't wear boots||here at work, but...\nSo you agree, then, right?\nSandals?\nMost guys don't know||they're called mules, do they?\nYou can just||slip them on...\n..."
