#. y1:english="So, Kazuma-san,{MS:0}||do you fall head over heels for your girl?\nYou do know you're talking||to a guy who used to be a gangster, right?\nNo, it couldn't happen.\nNo, that's not what I mean.||Not that you buy them gifts and all;\nI mean emotionally.||You always want to hear\nwhat she has to say...||Henpecked, or something like that.\nYeah{MS:0}!||That's what I thought.\nWhat are you so happy about?\nJust that you're exactly the type of person||I thought you were.\nThat's surprising.{MS:0}||So even you can fall in love?\nYou didn't think so?\nNo, not really.||That's not a bad thing, though. Haha.\nReally{MS:0}?||That's not what I would have thought.\nReally?\nIn that case,||what kind of girl do you fall for?\nTell me!❤\nOh, a girl like that, {MS:0}huh?||That sounds a little like me,\nbut in some ways I think I'm different.||I'm not sure. Hahaha.\nReally{MS:0}?\nThat's the type of girl||I'd like to become.\nYou would?\nSo, if someday I become like that||you won't mind being under my thumb?\n...\nReally{MS:0}? That's a girl that||doesn't say much but takes action swiftly?\nYeah, maybe.\nI see what you mean.||But that's not the type of girl I am.\nI'm kind of depressed now."
#: MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN:25_12_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MINIGAME/TALK_MGAME_CABARET_SPA.BIN::line:25_12_0"
msgid "Bueno, Kazuma-san{MS:0}; ¿eres de los||que se enamoran locamente de su novia?"
msgstr ""

