#. y1:english="Hey, Kazuma-san{MS:0}. Where do you||like to go on dates?\nWhere do you have in mind?\nIn this town.\nOoh. So {MS:0}drab.\nBut recently the number of shops||catering to young people is increasing...\nI like the older shops.\nYeah, having the||old familiar shops makes it\nrefreshing, doesn't it?\nMe, {MS:0}too!\nReally?\nI like the Christmas tree they have||at Millennium Tower.\nI could stare at it for hours.||Literally.❤ Haha.\nDon Quijote{MS:0}?||I like it, too.\nThey have so many different things.||It's fun.\nWhen you find something strange and unique,||it sort of gives you a sense of pleasure.\nHm. Okay, let's go there together||sometime.\nThey have famous brands there, too.||Haha."
