#. y1:english="Ah, just {MS:0}what I thought!||It's so comfortable over here.\nThe last customer had me||drink so much.\nI'm hammered.\nHe was trying to get me drunk and||entice me into bed with him.\nHow annoying!\nYou're so {MS:0}nice, Kazuma-san.\nI'll give you||the best service.\nYou've been drinking a lot, haven't you?\nI'm okay!\nI like drinking with you,||Kazuma-san.\nHow me{MS:0}an, Kazuma-san!\nIf I pass out, it's||your fault.\nOops!||...{MS:0}I'm sorry!\nI was just caught up in the moment...||And...\n...\nAre you mad?\nI'm {MS:0}sorry...\nWill you forgive me?\n...Okay.\nHaha. {MS:0} Alright!||I was worried.\nYou're intense||when you're angry.\nYour eyes...||A girl could get lost in them.\nThat's {MS:0}true.||But I'll try not\nto do anything to make you stare at me||from now on.\n...\nOkay. {MS:0}Oh!\nWhat is it?\n...I'm {MS:0}sorry.||Today I have to go home.\nWhat's wrong?\nMy mom's mad at me||for not talking to her much lately.\nSo she said she wasn't going to go to bed||today until we had a little talk.\nShe still treats me||like a little child.\nSo our little date will have to||be some other time, Kazuma-san.\nHahaha{MS:0}. Okay.\nBut I like hide-and-seek||better, though.\nYou do?\nI know how to make it fun...\n...\nKazuma-san?\n...\nI'm sorry.||You're really mad, aren't you.\nI'll make up for it,||so forgive me, okay?"
